;
; How Gazette files one item's read state, in MYRA (gazette_rules.h GR3):
; its source (its place in the model's source list, 3 digits) and its
; place in the reading list (12 digits), its order key (lamport: the
; Lamport time, the envelope id, the event index or the relay time, 18
; digits), when it was written in ms since 1970 (13 digits, to the year
; 2286; 0 unknown) and its state (0 unread, 1 read). Gazette asks whether
; the numbers fit before it keeps an item or marks it read.
^ZXGAZETTE(source:i3, item:i12) = lamport:i18! ^ stamp:i13! ^ state:i1!
